  "description": "Sweetgrass Botanicals Infused Olive Oil brings premium cannabis convenience to your kitchen with 250mg of THC in every bottle. This versatile edible oil seamlessly integrates into your culinary routine, perfect for drizzling over salads, finishing pasta dishes, or elevating your favorite recipes with cannabis-infused flavor. The smooth, rich olive oil base delivers a naturally earthy and savory profile that complements both sweet and savory applications. Ideal for those seeking precise dosing control, this infused oil allows you to customize your experience by the drop. Whether you're an experienced chef or new to cannabis cooking, this product offers a discreet and delicious way to enjoy the benefits of THC while exploring creative culinary possibilities. Simply start with a small amount, wait to assess effects, and adjust accordingly for your perfect dose.",
